  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 11}那么，我去叫花村阳介先生。\n请稍等片刻。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_550.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 29 11}让您久等了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_550.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}真是个大陷阱啊。\n没想到她们居然掌握着\n蘸酱这个火锅的命脉……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_550.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，火锅本身是成功了，\n我也像这样平安无事，对吧？\n委托算是圆满完成了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_550.bf.json:2:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 02}所以，这就是报酬。\n收下吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
